      <title>Income Taxpayers Alert! Section 80C is going to change from April 1 - BusinessToday</title>
      <link>https://www.businesstoday.in/personal-finance/tax/story/income-tax-act-2025-section-80c-becomes-section-123-from-april-1-2026-heres-what-taxpayers-must-know-522120-2026-03-24?utm_source=rssfeed</link>
      <description>Under the Income Tax Act, 2025, the popular Section 80C deduction of up to ₹1.5 lakh for investments such as PPF, ELSS, insurance, NSC and home loan principal will move to Section 123, with eligible instruments listed in Schedule XV, while the deduction limit remains unchanged.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.businesstoday.in/personal-finance/tax/story/income-tax-act-2025-section-80c-becomes-section-123-from-april-1-2026-heres-what-taxpayers-must-know-522120-2026-03-24?utm_source=rssfeed</guid>
